# Reloved Layout & Motion

## Navbar

Follow `frontend/src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx`:

- Fixed `top-4`, centered `max-w-6xl`
- `bg-white border-2 border-foreground shadow-[4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]`
- Links: `font-display font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest`

## Footer

High-contrast dark footer (`bg-foreground` / black), white type, `border-t-4 border-foreground`. Subheads: `text-accent-green uppercase tracking-widest`.

## Manifesto callout

```tsx
<div className="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 border-foreground shadow-[6px_6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] max-w-2xl mx-auto rounded-none">
  <p className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-black italic text-foreground">
    “Because preloved only costs kindness.”
  </p>
</div>
```

## Physical wall metaphor

- Poster grids use slight rotation + `<Tape />` from `@/components/assets/RelovedAssets`
- Keep the global `.texture-overlay` noise (do not add extra glow layers)
- `GraffitiMarks` / graffiti backgrounds are decorative only; never replace lucide icons

## Motion (`motion/react`)

- Easing: `ease: [0.32, 0.72, 0, 1]` (same as `cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)`)
- Micro: `0.2s`–`0.35s`; layout: `~0.4s`
- Entry: `initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 16 }}` → `animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}`
- Multi-step forms/wizards: wrap in `<AnimatePresence mode="wait">` with horizontal slide (`x: 20 → 0 → -20`)

## Scope

These rules apply only to Reloved **frontend** UI (`frontend/`). Do not restyle backend templates, emails, or admin APIs with this system unless the file is under `frontend/`.
